      "params": {
        "CommentText": "WGS-84: normal gravity on and above the reference ellipsoid\ng = ge * (1 + k * sin(latitude)^2) / sqrt(1 - e2 * sin(latitude)^2)\ng_h = g * (1 - 2*(1 + f + m - 2*f*sin(latitude)^2)*(h/a) + 3*(h/a)^2)\nLatitude in radians; gravity in m/s^2.",
